> Because you need speed boots [...]

You do not need them (see above). Some boring details:
Doing a bit of source diving it shows that when you start putting
on the helmet, it is considered to be worn immediately. A delayed
action Helmet_on() will update the INT/WIS bonuses at the end of
the process. When the nymph steals some other armor which takes
some time to take off, this action will be overwritten by a new
one (stealarm()) such that the putting-on-effect will not take
place. Moreover the helmet then is no longer considered to be in
the process of putting on and stealing the helmet "re-adjusts"
the bonuses not given in the first place.

